# Panel 033 R5 reaches the library too (M-separate-compilation row 1).
# The library's names are visible unqualified (§1.11 Tier 2), and that
# visibility used to include its extern declarations: hero_args_count()
# from any user module was check-clean at exit 0, measured 2026-08-25,
# with zero users in the whole repository — the reversible moment to
# close it. Three spellings, one code: the bare call, the extern taken
# as a value, and UFCS through the dot.
#
# Corrected 2026-10-05, defect 245 (panel 192's R1): the library no longer
# binds `hero_file_read`; `read_file` reaches C through `hero_file_read_str`,
# which takes the `str` itself, so the dot's receiver is the `str` and the
# extern it names is that one.

function main()
    n = hero_args_count()          #~ extern_across_modules
    print(n)
    _ = hero_exit                  #~ extern_across_modules
    status: i64 @ 0
    _ = "p".hero_file_read_str(@status)    #~ extern_across_modules
    print(status)
